{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lalalune/pumpfun-source/pulls/408","id":5046577717,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVWUACM8AAAABLMyqNQ","html_url":"https://github.com/lalalune/pumpfun-source/pull/408","diff_url":"https://github.com/lalalune/pumpfun-source/pull/408.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/lalalune/pumpfun-source/pull/408.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lalalune/pumpfun-source/issues/408","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lalalune/pumpfun-source/pulls/408/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lalalune/pumpfun-source/pulls/408/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lalalune/pumpfun-source/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lalalune/pumpfun-source/issues/408/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lalalune/pumpfun-source/statuses/a48351294a2f6d578a7d2c6e5148d25ae399583e","number":408,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Recover complete AMM fee caller with a native value copy (732 to 733)","user":{"login":"hongikAn","id":74804977,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0ODA0OTc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74804977?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn","html_url":"https://github.com/hongikAn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The original AMM `calculate_fee` caller copies its 24-byte fee payload into a local value before calling the native method. The current source borrows that payload directly and emits640 bytes. Changing **`match data` to `match *data`** restores the original 696-byte/80-instruction function at 0x74648.\n\nOn the same normal full-contract recipe this is **732 -> 733/785 normalized functions**, with all 148 raw matches retained and no losses. The newly matched caller actually calls the previously recovered 368-byte method from merged #405. Five real direct callee bodies and all seven typed root references agree, including six vtable methods and the Source filename/line 49/error 6023. Incoming graphs and transitive data are not claimed identical.\n\nValidation:\n- One changed file among 54 inputs; no dependency, lock, arithmetic or compiler-flag changes. Two new normal builds reproduce both whole ELF hashes with 396 dependency artifacts unchanged.\n- Qualified MIR/LLVM captures show the local24-byte copy responsible for the original three 8-byte machine copies. Both captures strip to their respective normal binaries; diagnostic outputs are kept separate.\n- 2,266 original/732/733 suite triples, 216 fresh-VM triples and 7 targeted error-path triples pass. Actual loader hashes, signatures and full message-account snapshots are retained. Existing buy/sell log differences remain 76/88. The additional synthetic invalid-fee fixture reaches the recovered wrapper's Overflow 6023 atline 49, with identical errors and rollback; six epoch controls overlap the larger matrix.\n- Local packet verification recomputes source bindings, body/call/data evidence and signed receipts. A dedicated CI audit is added.\n\nReview `research/amm-fee-value-call-recovery/source.patch` and README. The baseline is the actual retained 732 source/artifact from #405; previous results are not relabeled. The maintained checkpoint stays separate pending integration. Whole-ELF/raw target identity and exhaustive behavior remain unproved, and inherited unrelated admin stack-frame diagnostics remain in the logs.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-28T07:04:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:11:41Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"0ff76f83e62cc314ca7c96dad231de8acd9b14ae","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"hongikAn:codex/amm-fee-value-copy","ref":"codex/amm-fee-value-copy","repo":{"id":1435231819,"node_id":"R_kgDOVYvmSw","name":"pumpfun-source","full_name":"hongikAn/pumpfun-source","owner":{"login":"hongikAn","id":74804977,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0ODA0OTc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74804977?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn","html_url":"https://github.com/hongikAn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hongikAn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Pump.fun deployment evidence and byte-exact reconstruction research (incomplete)","homepage":null,"language":null,"visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"watchers":0,"open_issues_count":0,"open_issues":0,"size":8475993,"default_branch":"main","has_issues":false,"has_projects":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_do